value.RAIN_PUDDLES.0=Off
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.1=On
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=Photon-derived puddle coverage and darkened wet ground on exposed upward terrain. Excludes leaves; fades with weather wetness. No PBR textures required.
