value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.1=Sky (Fast)
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.2=Sky + Scene (Experimental)
option.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky reflections are the default. Scene adds 12 screen-space ray steps on wet pixels; offscreen geometry cannot be reflected and edges may flicker.

